WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Known endpoint D3 reports communication with 192.0.2.87, which has no matching endpoint record.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Known network device ND1 communicates with unmatched address 198.51.100.64. Keep the two endpoints separate.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
CMDB discovery scans an IP range and detects 192.0.2.47, but cannot classify it as a Server, Computer, Printer or Router.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Check the source and evidence, then establish identity, device type and ownership. An unknown address is not proof of malicious activity.
